    "advancement": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 3rd level, you may enter a serene stance for 1 minute when you use chi points. While in this stance, you use your Wisdom modifier for your attack and damage rolls when attacking with a monk weapon or your unarmed strikes.</p><p>Your serenity ends early if you become charmed, frightened, or incapacitated, or if you try to accomplish a task more strenuous than interacting with an object.</p>",
